<Events>
    <!--Campaign: Amthor. Created by Sil taTener-->
	<Warlord side="1" name="Dragon" city="Capital" level="17" portrait="35" major="3" minor="3">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="2" name="Dragon" city="Capital" level="15" portrait="35" major="3" minor="0">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="3" name="Dragon" city="Capital" level="14" portrait="35" major="3" minor="1">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="4" name="Dragon" city="Capital" level="13" portrait="35" major="3" minor="2">
	</Warlord>


    <!--Story start-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="1"/>
		<Message>希安特拉派来一名使者，由三只鹰身女妖护送。|精灵已研究过那枚护符，结论毫无疑问：|它出自龙族之手。|希安特拉将鹰身女妖交给你指挥，希望她们能助你伸张正义。|你前往边境地区的西湾，从这里必须渡海。你要追踪古老的火龙基林，它栖身于四座龙岛之一。千万小心——你即将踏入龙族之境。</Message>
		<Action type="unit" data1="40" data2="3" data3="3"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn_or_later" data1="10"/>
		<Trigger type="chance" data1="20"/>
		<Message>希安特拉又派来几只鹰身女妖，叮嘱你意志坚定，|出手务必果决！</Message>
		<Action type="unit" data1="40" data2="3" data3="3"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn_or_later" data1="20"/>
		<Trigger type="chance" data1="20"/>
		<Message>希安特拉派来一只精锐鹰身女妖。别退缩！</Message>
		<Action type="unit" data1="40" data2="1" data3="9"/>
	</Event>

  
    <!-- Warlord Win Option -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="2">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="2"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>

    <!-- Warlord Win Message -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
		<Message>你攻占了龙族首都，却一无所获。既没有护符的线索，|也没有基林的踪迹。|这场追逐似乎越来越扑朔迷离……</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="w1"/>
		<Message>你击倒了第二座岛上的巨龙。它身受致命重伤，|挣扎着吐出最后几个词：“……读懂星辰……|难道你没看见那轮盘……它正在转动……”|你根本不明白巨龙所指为何，也再没有机会追问——它已经死了。</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="3" String1="w1"/>
		<Message>你进入堡垒，只见一头老龙坐在内院，缓缓展开双翼。|你刚举起法杖想要阻止，它便腾空而起，|向西北方飞去。</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="4">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="4"/>
		<Message>你攻占龙族首都，立刻便有所感应：基林就在附近！|忽然，一个低沉的声音在脑海中响起：“你来迟了，|阿姆索尔！”|你猛然转身，却看不见巨龙。“自从我看见星辰排列出的古怪征兆，便一直在注视着你。一场神意的变迁正触及艾瑟里亚。矮人与巨龙每一刻都在靠近彼此，难道你感受不到？”|你用双手捂住耳朵，但那声音仍在继续：“你还无法理解真相。不过很快，你就会明白。”|低沉的声音停顿片刻，换成了一种父亲般的口吻：“去巨人丘陵吧。那里的人替……唔，你叫她……希安特拉！……制作了那枚护符。”|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 09》……</Message>
		<Action type="victory" data1="0"/>
	</Event>

</Events>
